. Okay, that matches my previous result. So I think that's correct. Maybe I should do a quick check using estimation. \n\n450,573 is approximately 450,000 and 205,851 is about 205,000. Adding those gives 655,000. The actual sum is 656,424, which is a bit higher, which makes sense because I rounded down both numbers. The difference is about 1,424, which is the sum of the parts I omitted (573 and 851). 573 + 851 is 1,424, so that checks out. \n\nTherefore, I'm confident the answer is 656,424.\n</think>\n\n",
