ndreds:3+3=6\n\nThousands:5+5=10 (carry 1)\n\nTen thousands:3+3=6 +1=7\n\nHundred thousands:8+8=16\n\nSo combining all digits with the carryover gives 1,670,689. \n\nWait, but when I add 835,348 and 835,341, maybe I can think of it as (800,000 + 35,348) + (800,000 + 35,341) = 1,600,000 + (35,348 +35,341). Then 35,348 +35,341 is 70,689. So total is 1,670,689. That matches. \n\nOkay, so I think that's correct. The answer should be 1,670,689.\n</think>\n\n",
