y 1)\n\nMillions place: the carried 1.\n\nSo the total is 1 6 4 0 4 2 8, which is 1,640,428. Hmm, that seems right. Let me verify using another method. Maybe adding the numbers in parts.\n\n859,500 + 700,000 = 1,559,500. Then add 80,928 (since 780,928 -700,000=80,928). So 1,559,500 +80,928 = 1,640,428. Yep, same result. Okay, so the answer should be correct.\n</think>\n\n",
