heir components:\n\n771,461 = 700,000 + 70,000 + 1,000 + 400 + 60 +1\n\n780,258 = 700,000 + 80,000 + 0 + 200 + 50 +8\n\nAdding each component:\n\n700,000 +700,000 = 1,400,000\n\n70,000 +80,000 = 150,000\n\n1,000 +0 =1,000\n\n400 +200 =600\n\n60 +50 =110\n\n1 +8 =9\n\nNow add all those together:\n\n1,400,000 +150,000 =1,550,000\n\n1,550,000 +1,000 =1,551,000\n\n1,551,000 +600 =1,551,600\n\n1,551,600 +110 =1,551,710\n\n1,551,710 +9 =1,551,719\n\nYes, that matches. So the answer is correct. I think that's thorough enough. Maybe I overcomplicated the steps, but better safe than sorry.\n</think>\n\n",
