sands:7+8+1=16 \u2714\ufe0f (carry 1)  \nHundred thousands:6+9+1=16 \u2714\ufe0f (carry 1)  \nMillions:1 \u2714\ufe0f  \n\nYes, that adds up correctly. So the final answer should be 1,661,368.\n</think>\n\n",
