849. Then +2,075: 562,849 +2,000=564,849, then +75=564,924. Yes, that matches. So the answer is correct. I think my initial mistake was when I first thought the thousands place had a 7, but that was the tens place. So the correct sum is 564,924.\n</think>\n\n",
